From 9876c0572d934df180d0f478827c2a52a72fffd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:34:03 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Remove old_text from the mutation API: mutate.c reads
 it from the buffer

No caller needs to supply it.  Over make test and 4,000 key-fuzz seeds, every
valid range's old_text equalled what collectRegionText gives; the only
differences were at invalid ranges, where the supplied text was wrong.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01947MBgCkoERXfoyRGfCmQi
